    "description": {
      "summary": "The caster emulates the disturbing cacophony of sounds and words that sane life was not meant to hear from a Skull Dragon",
      "value": "<p>The caster emulates the disturbing cacophony of sounds and words that sane life was not meant to hear from a Skull Dragon. All creatures in a 60-foot radius must make a Will save or be confused for 1d6 rounds and take 1d6 points of Wisdom damage. A creature that saves cannot be affected by this spell for 24 hours. This is a sonic mind-affecting effect. Learned From Skull Dragon</p>"
